        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MS212 13-1/8 Inch Mail Slot With Interior Flap</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis solid brass letter slot measures 13-1/8\". It has and interior flap along with the exterior flap. A complete package, this Deltana made MS212 Mail Slot comes packaged with exterior and interior metal covers, frames, and installation screws. Available in 9 different finishes including polished brass, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MS212-dimentions.gif?v=1704354634\" width=\"600\" height=\"376\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MS212 Mail Door Slot Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana MS212 Door Mail Slot:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Hole Centers: 12\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Hole Centers: 2-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Interior Opening Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Opening Height: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Loaded Exterior Flap</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Del-MS212.pdf?v=1704262298\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MS212 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the mail slot door will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
